Current Version can be found [[Gyftrot|here]].

Gyftrot existed from the start as a 4/8 for 8G Rare Taunt that makes the owner draw a card upon death, but hadn't changed once until all the way into '''Beta 12.1''', where it got -1 HP and -1 Cost. '''Beta 20.2''' reverted that back, but also gave it +1 ATK. '''Beta 24.0''' gave it -1 HP again, but only that, and it was reverted in '''Beta 43.1.'''

'''Beta 54.1''' changed it into a [[:Category:Base|Base]], alongside [[Dad Slime]], replacing [[Royal Guard 1|RG 01]] and [[Royal Guard 2|RG 02]].
