=== Trivia ===
* Its nerf in Beta 24.0 was listed as a buff in the patch notes. This was due to the card mistakenly having its COST decresed from 8 to 7 rather of its HP. This was quickly fixed.
*Its transition to Base Beta 54.1 marks the only time a card was changed from Rare straight into Base.
**[[Charles]] is the only Base card that ever was a Rare, but was turned into a Common first.

